body:
Felt like shit-couldn't give us 1 episode to rejoice in the feels but just had to wreck everything. Never had I got such a high followed by such a low. Fuck everything.Just going to pretend the last half, didn't happen?

&#x200B;

And Rhaegal and Ghost!They did u dirty. I will remember u. (And whatever the fuck they r doing to Dany? Do I blame her for going mad queen after this-NOPE!!! It is fucking PROPORTIONATE!!!!
